        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>High Security Rim Cylinder</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese rim cylinders are used on deadbolts. For use with deadbolts made by  Baldwin, Grandeur, Omnia, Falcon and other manufacturers. Can be used with all single cylinder deadbolts that use a rim cylinder with a lazy tail piece. *Please note the dimension of the 2 rear mounting screw holes shown below. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/206S-KIDBA_size.gif?v=1704354522\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"MUL-T-LOCK High Security Rim Cylinder\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSupplied standard with 1 owner key card and 2 keys per cylinder. Available in 7 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock 206SP-KIDBA Rim Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Supplied with Security Ring</li>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>MUL-T-LOCK's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Saves time and money on future lock replacements or re-keying when employes leave.  Remove the worry about anyone make duplicates of your keys. <b>Keep your doors safe!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than 2 are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "High Security Deadbolt Rim Cylinder, Mul-T-Lock 206SP-KIDBA-xx",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock High security grade 1 restricted key locks. Rim cylinder for use with deadbolts made by Fusion, Baldwin, Grandeur, Omnia, Falcon and other manufactures.",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SP-KIDBA-xx High Security Deadbolt Rim Cylinders, Security rim Locks, rim locks, Bump Proof locks, rim cylinder locks, security door locks,"
            },
